## How to use

```bash
git clone https://git.vectorweight.com/tzervas/CogSynDelta.git
cd CogSynDelta
git checkout {{ code_revision }}
uv sync --group dev
```

The composed mind is not a single checkpoint download -- see `scripts/csd-train-all.py`
and `config/mind/csd-regions.json` for how the regions are assembled at run time.

## Limitations and out-of-scope use

PoC-scale composition. Not a general-purpose chat model. Cross-faculty pairing
(`visual_pairs`, and any other cross-region measurement) is `NOT MEASURED` unless a
table above says otherwise. The LICENSE contradiction noted above is unresolved as of
this card; do not treat the printed `license:` tag in the front matter as a final
determination -- see Licence.

